{"id":"e674660f3ecfac15","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-direct-extension.md","title":"ZFC Direct Extension","display":"df-zfc-direct-extension — ZFC Direct Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-direct-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-direct-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-direct-extension — ZFC Direct Extension","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-forcing]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-direct-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-direct-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-direct-extension — ZFC Direct Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in P\">\\(p,q\\in P\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\,\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\,\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{stem},\\operatorname{tail},B_s,B_t\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{stem},\\operatorname{tail},B_s,B_t\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> are the sourced predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectExtension}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectExtension}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (relation with the forcing carrier, order, stem, and tail maps explicit)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectExtension}_S(q,p;P,\\leq_P,\\operatorname{stem},\\operatorname{tail})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p,q\\in P\n\\land\\exists B_s,B_t\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{stem},P,B_s)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{tail},P,B_t)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\n\\land\\operatorname{stem}(q)=\\operatorname{stem}(p)\n\\land\\operatorname{tail}(q)\\subseteq\\operatorname{tail}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectExtension}_S(q,p;P,\\leq_P,\\operatorname{stem},\\operatorname{tail})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p,q\\in P\n\\land\\exists B_s,B_t\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{stem},P,B_s)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{tail},P,B_t)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\n\\land\\operatorname{stem}(q)=\\operatorname{stem}(p)\n\\land\\operatorname{tail}(q)\\subseteq\\operatorname{tail}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Direct extension is relative to explicit forcing data; different Prikry-style forcings may choose different stem and tail maps.</li>\n<li>The two maps have set codomain witnesses; the definition does not use the proper class expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^P\">\\(V^P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in V$, $p,q\\in P$, and $\\leq_P\\,\\subseteq P\\times P$ (see [[58-df-forcing]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\,\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{stem},\\operatorname{tail},B_s,B_t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectExtension}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}direct\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DirectExtension}_S(q,p;P,\\leq_P,\\operatorname{stem},\\operatorname{tail})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p,q\\in P\n\\land\\exists B_s,B_t\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{stem},P,B_s)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{tail},P,B_t)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\n\\land\\operatorname{stem}(q)=\\operatorname{stem}(p)\n\\land\\operatorname{tail}(q)\\subseteq\\operatorname{tail}(p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V^P","display":false}],"bytes":1520,"backlinks":[{"id":"9ad702bee3bdfee2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectExtension}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (see [[58-df-zfc-direct-extension]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-direct-extension]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1854","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-direct-extension.md|58-df-zfc-direct-extension]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d06ac5a66d69d291","d3f859dbdd37f018","36d7463d215be751"]}